@startuml
title POTA to OSM Updater - reconciliation flow
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBorderColor #123D5A
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBackgroundColor #EEF7FA
skinparam ArrowColor #176B85
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #123D5A
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #EEF7FA
actor Contributor
participant "Browser UI" as UI
participant "Reconciliation route" as API
participant "POTA CSV" as CSV
participant "Overpass" as O
participant "Changeset route" as C
Contributor -> UI : choose country + region
Contributor -> UI : click Reconcile sources
UI -> API : POST /api/reconcile
API --> UI : progress: fetching CSV
API -> CSV : GET all_parks_ext.csv
CSV --> API : active parks
API --> UI : progress: loading Overpass
API -> O : POST query for POTA entities
O --> API : JSON entities + tags
API -> API : normalize names, filter existing, score candidates
loop each scoped park
  API -> API : throttled Photon/Nominatim search
  API -> API : verify OSM object has no POTA tag
  API --> UI : progress: park counter + candidates
end
API --> UI : complete: suggestions + confidence
UI --> Contributor : show review queue
loop each proposed match
  Contributor -> UI : approve or clear
end
Contributor -> UI : prepare changeset
UI -> C : POST approved candidates
C --> UI : OsmChange XML
UI --> Contributor : download .osc
note over Contributor,UI
  Import into JOSM or another editor,
  inspect changes, then upload under
  the contributor's own OSM session.
end note
@enduml
